<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Round Mountain (Ochocos) by the ridge and the summer trail</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:321-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.349967" lon="-120.349431"><ele>1653.8</ele><name>Independent Pass (Road 42 at Road 4205)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:road-42-4205 (OSM node 3094976843), shared with 319-3; confidence: high; pdf_page: 323; book_elev_ft: 5400; quote: From Independent Pass at 5,400 feet (see Lookout Mountain description)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.370690" lon="-120.348660"><ele>1706.9</ele><name>Road 150 pass (trail 805 meets the road)</name><desc>source: vertex where USFS trail 805 joins road 4200150; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 323; quote: traverse the slopes on the east side of the ridge (along the summer trail) to eventually connect with the road at the pass</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.372600" lon="-120.356200"><ele>1702.4</ele><name>End of road 150</name><desc>source: west end of USFS road 4200150; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 323; quote: Continue along the last 0.4 mile to the end of the road on the west side of the ridge</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.377390" lon="-120.352710"><ele>1744.3</ele><name>Back on the ridge (trail 805)</name><desc>source: vertex of USFS trail 805 on the ridge north of the road end; confidence: low; pdf_page: 323; quote: From here, ski onto the ridge, eventually reaching ponderosa parklands</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.392574" lon="-120.343744"><ele>1998.6</ele><name>4WD road below the summit</name><desc>source: where trail 805 meets road 4200200 (Round Mountain Road); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 323; quote: circling eastward while climbing to eventually connect with the four-wheel-drive road just below the summit</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.392296" lon="-120.346747"><ele>2057.8</ele><name>Round Mountain summit</name><desc>source: OSM node 357314892 Round Mountain; end of road 4200200; confidence: high; pdf_page: 323; book_elev_ft: 6753; quote: The rounded, bare 6,753-foot summit of Round Mountain</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Round Mountain (Ochocos) by the ridge and the summer trail</name><desc>1. Independent Pass (Road 42 at Road 4205) -&gt; Road 150 pass (trail 805 meets the road): usfs-trail (medium), 2.33 mi | 2. Road 150 pass (trail 805 meets the road) -&gt; End of road 150: usfs-road (high), 0.53 mi | 3. End of road 150 -&gt; Back on the ridge (trail 805): straight (low), 0.37 mi | 4. Back on the ridge (trail 805) -&gt; 4WD road below the summit: usfs-trail (medium), 1.65 mi | 5. 4WD road below the summit -&gt; Round Mountain summit: usfs-road (high), 0.33 mi</desc>
